# OKF mandates UTF-8, LF-only — and the validator reports CRLF rather than normalising it
# (okf-conventions §2). Windows checkouts default to autocrlf, which would hand every text file
# to the validator with CRLF and fail docs:check on files that are clean in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
